OL,5,CTRAIN CRASHFin Staffordshire:
OL,6, Fone dead, more than 50 hurt...103B203
OL,8,CSOUTH AFRICAFHowe meets Tambo
OL,9,F for talks in London...........113B213
OL,10,FUp to five killed in Soweto....114B214
OL,12,CSTOCKHOLMFNo agreement likely
OL,13,F today at security conference..106B206
OL,15,CUSA-USSRFexploratory summit
OL,16,F talks continue................104B204
OL,17,FDaniloff case "being used".....105B205
OL,19,CN IRELANDFBomb attacks on
OL,20,F Catholic homes................111B211
