CT,8,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F181A1789941877
OL,1,  V<,,4<,,4<,,4Spp0pp0p``0pp0      G5/10
OL,2,T]V5b(55b(55j5Sj5.%jj5/l4
OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, Foreign Secretary Sir Geoffrey Howe has
OL,6, met the acting head of the exiled
OL,7, African National Congress in London.
OL,9,FA foreign office spokesman said Sir
OL,10,FGeoffrey and Mr Oliver Tambo had had
OL,11,Fa good, candid and open meeting.
OL,13,FThe two hours of talks centred on the
OL,14,Fcurrent situation in South Africa and
OL,15,Fprospects for a peaceful settlement
OL,16,Fthere, the spokesman said.
OL,18,FSir Geoffrey emphasised Britain's
OL,19,Fopposition to apartheid and its wish
OL,20,Fto see rapid, fundamental but peaceful
OL,21,Fchange.
OL,23,T]CFrom 20-09-86   teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
FL,182,180,120,250,0,100
PN,18106
SC,0006
CT,8,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F181A1789941877
OL,1,  V<,,4<,,4<,,4Spp0pp0p``0pp0      G6/10
OL,2,T]V5b(55b(55j5Sj5.%jj5/l4
OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, Reports from South Africa say up to
OL,6, five people have been shot dead in an
OL,7, incident in the township of Soweto.
OL,9,FThe Bureau for Information said a 24-
OL,10,Fyear-old woman was killed when police
OL,11,Fopened fire on a crowd which was
OL,12,Fstoning passing cars.
OL,14,FLocal residents said between two and
OL,15,Ffive people were killed and another 12
OL,16,Finjured in violence during a night
OL,17,Fvigil for a murder victim.
OL,19,FPolice action went far beyond that
OL,20,Fdescribed in the official account, they
OL,21,Fsaid.
OL,23,T]CFrom 20-09-86   teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
