OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F181A1789941877
OL,1,  V<,,4<,,4<,,4Spp0pp0p``0pp0      G7/10
OL,2,T]V5b(55b(55j5Sj5.%jj5/l4
OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, No effective agreement is expected to
OL,6, be reached today at the Stockholm arms
OL,7, control conference.
OL,9,FDelegates "stopped the clock" at the
OL,10,Fconference so they could continue talks
OL,11,Ftoday without breaching the midnight
OL,12,Fdeadline for the 32-month negotiations.
OL,13,         F
OL,14,FObservers now believe that an agreement
OL,15,Fis more likely on Monday.
OL,17,FThe conference is attempting to devise
OL,18,Fa formula whereby major troop movements
OL,19,Fin Europe would be announced in advance
OL,20,Fand on-site inspections of military
OL,21,Fformations would be allowed.
OL,23,T]CFrom 20-09-86   teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
FL,182,180,120,250,0,100
PN,18108
